## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> **Table Alias Normalization**: The physical MySQL database uses table names `role`, `withdrawal_request`, and `automatic_transactions`. The system maps canonical names `user_role`, `withdrawal`, and `automatic_transactions_bank` and automatically translates them during MySQL query execution without requiring the user to know internal database schema names.
>
> All database access remains **100% READ-ONLY**.

